                                                   107 ***********************************************************************
                                                   108 * (pending     E754 VGEM   - Vector Generate Element Masks
                                                   109 *  inclusion in SATK ASAM)
                                                   110 *
                                                   111 *     VGEM Macro to help build VGEM instruction
                                                   112 *        VGEM   m3
                                                   113 *
                                                   114 *        Note: v1, v2 are fixed vector registers:
                                                   115 *                         v1 = 1; v2 = 2
                                                   116 ***********************************************************************
                                                   117          MACRO
                                                   118          VGEM  &M3
                                                   119 .*                                     &M3  - m3 for VGEM instruction
                                                   120          LCLA  &M3RXB
                                                   121 &M3RXB   SETA  +(&M3*16)
                                                   122                                                                SPACE 1
                                                   123          DS    0H                      E754 VGEM
                                                   124          DC    X'E7'                   - Vector Generate Element Masks
                                                   125          DC    X'12'                    v1, v2
                                                   126          DC    x'0000'                  reserved
                                                   127          DC    HL1'&M3RXB'              M3, RXB
                                                   128          DC    X'54'
                                                   129                                                                SPACE 1
                                                   130          MEND
