                                                   465 *
                                                   466          MACRO
                                                   467          VRR_A &INST,&M3
                                                   468 .*                               &INST   - VRR-a instruction under test
                                                   469 .*                               &M3     - m3 field
                                                   470
                                                   471          GBLA  &TNUM
